    "generator": "Codex CLI 0.162.0 built-in image generation tool on the ChatGPT sign-in (exec model gpt-6-astra; the tool did not report an image model name).",
    "composition": "scripts/compose.mjs: lamp-on = lit base; lamp-off = lit base outside the warm region and the dark edit inside it (graded, dilated 3px, feathered 2px); alpha always taken from the base, so registration is identical by construction. scripts/finish.mjs: crop x 168..1368 of the 1536x1024 output around the cord, Lanczos upscale x1.3, pad to 1560x1560. Native lamp size in the generated image was 1095x922 px; the masters (1423x1200 lamp) are that render upscaled, not extra detail. The lit inner shade of lamp-on was then graded toward design C's #fed587-#fedb8f (grade.py: each channel scaled by C's gold over the render's, weighted by saturation, only where lit and unlit differ; alpha untouched), and every delivery copy re-encoded as the art track encodes them (deliver.mjs: Lanczos, WebP q90 with full-quality alpha, AVIF q68 4:4:4). bulb-glow is a procedural radial glow on the same canvas.",
    "references": [
      "owner-approved design C (12ui-modern/approved-C.png)",
      "C's lamp at 3x (refs/c-lamp-3x.png)"
    ],
