  "light": {
    "made": "2026-10-10",
    "origin": "Hand-written SVG: a 160px tile of feTurbulence fractal noise turned into sparse light and dark specks, the light ones up to 18% opaque and the dark ones up to 0.6%, balanced so that over the lamp's warm light they neither lighten nor darken it on average. Laid over the hero's light, the section pools and the close's pool, and confined to them, it dithers their long faint falloff so it shows no rings (polish pass, 10 October 2026).",
